    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.completion\n\n### Description\n\nUsing the following config, but it doesn't set the border for the first completion list\r\n\r\n<img width=\"787\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-03-09 at 20 37 02\" src=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/97480229/7fe3e087-90b2-44e0-88e0-4549baac94f6\">\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n      require('mini.completion').setup {\r\n        window = {\r\n          info = { border = 'rounded' },\r\n          signature = { border = 'rounded' },\r\n        },\r\n      }\r\n```",
